      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Coral. Muitos Corsola vivem nos mares limpos do sul. Aparentemente, eles não conseguem sobreviver em águas poluídas.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 3 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Água 1, Água 3 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 25% M / 75% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Corsola não possui evoluções conhecidas.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Harden, Tackle</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Bubble, Water Gun</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Recover</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Bubble Beam</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Refresh</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Ancient Power</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Spike Cannon</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Lucky Chant</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Brine</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Iron Defense</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Rock Blast</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Endure, Life Dew</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Aqua Ring</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Power Gem</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Earth Power, Flail, Mirror Coat</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Attract, Blizzard, Brine, Bulldoze, Calm Mind, Confide, Dig, Double Team, Earth Power, Earthquake, Endeavor, Explosion, Facade, Frustration, Hail, Hidden Power, Ice Beam, Icicle Spear, Icy Wind, Iron Defense, Light Screen, Liquidation, Magic Coat, Meteor Beam, Nature Power, Protect, Psychic, Rain Dance, Reflect, Rest, Return, Rock Blast, Rock Polish, Rock Slide, Rock Tomb, Round, Safeguard, Sandstorm, Scald, Screech, Self-Destruct, Shadow Ball, Sleep Talk, Snore, Stealth Rock, Stomping Tantrum, Stone Edge, Substitute, Sunny Day, Surf, Swagger, Throat Chop, Toxic, Water Pulse, Whirlpool</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Amnesia, Aqua Ring, Barrier, Bide, Camouflage, Confuse Ray, Curse, Head Smash, Icicle Spear, Ingrain, Liquidation, Mist, Nature Power, Screech, Water Pulse</p>",
